.SS "const unsigned char * schultz_font_builtin_face (uint32_t index, size_t * out_size, uint32_t * out_token)"

.PP
One compiled in face, by position\&. The bytes are static and read only, so they outlive any font made from them and are never copied or freed\&.
.PP
Some of these faces fill a theme font slot and some do not\&. The two oblique Sans faces are here to complete the Sans family, so that asking for the italic member of a family has an answer without the host loading a file; they fill no slot, and report SCHULTZ_TOKEN_FONT_COUNT\&.
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIindex\fP Which face, from zero up to schultz_font_builtin_count\&. 
.br
\fIout_size\fP Receives the length in bytes\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.br
\fIout_token\fP Receives the theme font slot this face fills, or SCHULTZ_TOKEN_FONT_COUNT for one that fills none\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
The face bytes, or NULL for an index past the end\&. 
.RE
.PP

